</b>?","p":["snake","bat","leech","kangaroo"],"a":"kangaroo","aras":1},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.e137b7","j":"isi","s":"Animals that have a <b>shell</b> are ______.","bank":["cow","turtle","duck","giraffe"],"a":"turtle","aras":2},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.f659ad","j":"isi","s":"🦆 The special part of <b>duck</b> is ______.","bank":["long neck","flat beak","trunk","wings"],"a":"flat beak","aras":2},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.8053a6","j":"isi","s":"Animals with <b>long ears</b> are ______.","bank":["hedgehog","rabbit","cow","bird"],"a":"rabbit","aras":2},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.7c5174","j":"bs","s":"🐄 cows have long necks.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.925d2d","j":"bs","s":"<i>whales</i> move by flying.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.59a5be","j":"bs","s":"<i>octopus</i> moves by flying.","a":"False","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.c74116","j":"padankan","s":"Match the animals with their body parts.","pasangan":[["fish","🐟 fins"],["bird","🐦 wings"],["turtle","🐢 shell"],["cow","🐄 horn"]],"aras":2},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-5.c0b2dd","j":"jadual","s":"Classify animals according to how they move.","kepala":["Animals","How to move"],"bank":["fly","swim","jump","cascading"],"baris":[{"sel":["rabbit"],"a":"jump"},{"sel":["butterflies"],"a":"fly"},{"sel":["frog"],"a":"jump"},{"sel":["bat"],"a":"fly"}],"aras":3}]},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-6","nama":"Plants","soalan":[{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-6.d6e155","j":"mcq","s":"The <b>root</b> function is ______.","p":["absorb water from the soil","protect the seeds","support plants","make food"],"a":"absorb water from the soil","aras":1},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-6.3d8bb9","j":"mcq","s":"The part of the plant that <i>supports the plant</i> is ______.","p":["flowers","root","fruit","rod"],"a":"rod","aras":1},{"id":"t1-sains-dlp-6.3f9d57","j":"mcq","s":"The part of the plant that <i>produces fruit</i> is ______.","p":["rod","flowers","fruit","leaves"],"a":"flowers","aras":1}